<view class="page">
  <view class="profile-card">
    <view class="avatar">海</view>
    <view class="profile-main">
      <text class="profile-title">我的小海</text>
      <text class="profile-status">{{status}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{isLoggedIn}}" class="profile-status">ID {{consumerUserId}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button
    wx:if="{{!isLoggedIn}}"
    class="primary-btn"
    loading="{{isLoading}}"
    disabled="{{isLoading}}"
    bindtap="login"
  >
    微信登录
  </button>

  <view class="demo-note">
    保留现有 Consumer WeChat Login。订单、租借、加盟和分享佣金入口按各自服务端状态运行；会员仍为预览。
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">我的服务</text>
    </view>
    <view class="menu-list">
      <view
        class="menu-row"
        wx:for="{{features}}"
        wx:key="key"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="openFeature"
      >
        <view class="menu-copy">
          <text class="menu-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="menu-subtitle">{{item.subtitle}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
